    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Silent Ass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag it to the screen edge and it will snap to the border. No large icons on the taskbar - find it through the hidden icons tray for easier access during work hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Considerate Ass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Been working too long? Get up and stretch! Do some Kegel exercises to prevent hemorrhoids! Stay hydrated for better health! More thoughtful than your boss - while it can't pay your salary, it does consume your boss's electricity (even just a tiny bit), which technically means you're getting some petty revenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work Companion Ass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your daily off-duty time. If you're unlucky enough to work overtime, Butt will vent about your boss to provide emotional support. Just remember to dismiss the messages promptly - wouldn't want the boss to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Workshop Available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can share your boss's ass now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648180/extras/2ca8753dc16ba4648aad469e3ee1a73e.avif?t=1747078805\" data-has-big width=800 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May all players encounter bosses who never demand overtime and pay generous salaries! Wishing you the best!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's boss-complaining dialogue may contain sharp language (including profanity), but there is no nudity or sexual content.</p>",
